Wqo88J9nqdvADjiFADa.jpg"},{"id":1801783,"name":"Sonia Okacha","role":"La mère de W.R","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ZS63yei93UkzdAEin6CPubvLjf.jpg"},{"id":72950,"name":"Franc Bruneau","role":"Le prêtre","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fZhvGHZoY3exI6jwFEdcwFOBmGf.jpg"},{"id":1183778,"name":"Anthony Pho","role":"Ombre restaurant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/epDarUbNWMms3aS16kV8PVYoDbZ.jpg"},{"id":3093425,"name":"Abdelaziz Bouyadnaine","role":"Vendeur d'eau"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Una misteriosa luna rossa minaccia la Terra e l'astronauta Paul W.R sembra essere l'unico in grado di salvarla. Poco prima della partenza scompare: dietro la fuga si nasconde un segreto legato alla sua capacità di ascoltare i pensieri altrui."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Last Journey of the Enigmatic Paul W.R","overview":"The red moon threatens our existence on earth. Our only hope is the the most talented astronaut of his generation, the enigmatic Paul W.R. But a few hours before the start of the Great Mission, Paul disappears."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"La lune rouge menace notre existence sur terre. Notre seul espoir repose sur l’énigmatique Paul W.R, l’astronaute le plus talentueux de sa génération. Mais à quelques heures du départ de la Grande Mission, Paul a disparu. Celui que la terre entière considère comme un héros cache en fait un terrible secret : depuis son plus jeune âge, Paul W.R entend nos pensées ; des plus anecdotiques aux plus intimes. La conséquence de cet étrange don : Paul W.R ne nous supporte plus. S’il a accepté la Mission sans retour, ce n’est pas par héroïsme. C’est pour trouver, enfin, la quiétude d’un silence parfait. Loin de nos pensées."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pLzSMrKiFPcT0zwRyIRt8XP1k6.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aTftrYMGpa6O0h3gZBUKcqsYHOB.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
